  "title": {
   "en": "Kyuutei Madoushi, Tsuihou sareru ~Munouda to Oidasareta sai Takumi no Madoushi wa, Buka wo Hikitsurete Boukensha Kuran wo Hajimeru Youdesu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "宮廷魔導師、追放される　～無能だと追い出された最巧の魔導師は、部下を引き連れて冒険者クランを始めるようです～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Royal Court Magician Is Exiled - The Most Skilled Magician Who Was Banished for Being Incompetent Seems to Be Starting an Adventurer Clan With His Subordinates"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Arnaud, the Court Magician of the Desant Kingdom, known as one of the ‘Seven Masters,’ was busy defending his territory, which was overrun with powerful monsters. However, his modest achievements were deemed insufficient to fulfill his duties as one of the ‘Seven Masters,’ and he was exiled from the kingdom. Forced to leave with his loyal subordinates, Arnaud travels to the neighboring country of Linburu, where he becomes a legendary figure whose name is known by all for his true power!"
  },
